\newlabel{fig:confounder_heatmap}{{3}{9}{Per-category false positive rate heatmap for both BCE baselines (val set, seed\,42, $\tau {=}0.5$). River is the only category with non-zero FPs in either architecture; \EffNet {} BCE river FP rate (9.2\,\%) exceeds \ResNet {} BCE (3.9\,\%), identifying it as the primary target for \PHNM {} (\cref {tab:confounder})}{figure.caption.8}{}}
